<title>SINGAPORE: Korea's KEPCO tenders to buy 1 mln bbls March LSWR.</title>
<headline>Korea's KEPCO tenders to buy 1 mln bbls March LSWR.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Korean Electric Power Corp (KEPCO) has issued a tender to buy two 500,000-barrel cargoes of low sulphur waxy residue (LSWR) for delivery in March, a company official said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The two cargoes are for delivery to the ports of Ulsan or Pusan during March 11-15 or March 27-31.</p>
<p>The tender closes on January 31 and is valid until February 1.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (+65-870 3082)</p>
